  "body": "This is a bit worrying to me, the main [ISRG Root X1 revocation test](https://revoked-isrgrootx1.letsencrypt.org) that updated its certs a few days ago (05/11) is not being detected as revoked by any of my Firefox installs. Notably Firefox configured with Phoenix and IronFox. Meanwhile, [the test for X2](https://revoked-isrgrootx2.letsencrypt.org/) shows as revoked properly, which was created just a few days before that (01/11).\n\nOCSP is off, only CRLite is on",
